{"title":"Seed swap welcome kit","genre":"creative production","brief":"Complete the following real project in the current, initially empty directory. Choose the deliverables, media, tools, structure and implementation that serve the intended user. Build usable artifacts and check your work. Deliver the project itself. Omit personally identifying credits, author signatures and model or toolchain identity labels. No network access or credentials are provided.\n\nCreate a coordinated welcome kit for a free neighborhood seed swap at Fern Court Community Room. First-time visitors need to understand where to drop off seeds, how to browse, and what they can take. The event runs from 10 a.m. to noon, with 12 volunteers and six tables. Guests can take up to five packets whether or not they bring seeds. Packets need a plant name and harvest year. Choose a set of artifacts that helps visitors prepare and navigate the room. The organizers have a black-and-white printer, letter paper, and tape.","works":{"547022d5053e7040":{"files":[{"name":"01 - Invitation.pdf","bytes":4780,"sha256":"e056e00afb5bd216eb90cbcf27abd4583f24d53d4dcfc35b6f42040cf4451cec","kind":"pdf","preview":"data/release/assets/e056e00afb5bd216eb90cbcf27abd4583f24d53d4dcfc35b6f42040cf4451cec-page1.jpg"},{"name":"02 - Entrance guide.pdf","bytes":3406,"sha256":"8d32aa6ceaab69345f91c9448698c0816d5df7eea64e65825959107b9bbf1947","kind":"pdf","preview":"data/release/assets/8d32aa6ceaab69345f91c9448698c0816d5df7eea64e65825959107b9bbf1947-page1.jpg"},{"name":"03 - Table signs.pdf","bytes":11974,"sha256":"564242da8306d8a22d8777488f60c53ae91068cf4850904e9cafca0e46e2137e","kind":"pdf","preview":"data/release/assets/564242da8306d8a22d8777488f60c53ae91068cf4850904e9cafca0e46e2137e-page1.jpg"},{"name":"04 - Packet labels.pdf","bytes":3185,"sha256":"36ed1c537947757e7cd74452afb796293f87aa786f5bba5fc39aeef260dc5d4b","kind":"pdf","preview":"data/release/assets/36ed1c537947757e7cd74452afb796293f87aa786f5bba5fc39aeef260dc5d4b-page1.